bottomparticipants

actor Admin
boundary "Genre Management UI" as UI
boundary Router
control GenreController
control GenreService
entity GenreModel
database MongoDB

Admin -> UI: 1. Click "Hide/Unhide" button
activate Admin
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. PATCH /genre/{id}/toggle-status
activate Router

alt Token invalid
    Router --> UI: 2.1.1. 401 Unauthorized
    UI --> Admin: 2.1.2. Show error message
else Role invalid
    Router --> UI: 2.2.1. 403 Forbidden
    UI --> Admin: 2.2.2. Show error message
end
Router -> GenreController: 3. toggleStatus(id)
activate GenreController

GenreController -> GenreService: 4. toggleStatus(id)
activate GenreService

opt Invalid ObjectId
    GenreService --> GenreController: 4.1. Throw BadRequest
    GenreController --> Router: 4.2. HTTP 400 response
    Router --> UI: 4.3. Invalid ID error
    UI --> Admin: 4.4. Show error message
end
GenreService -> GenreModel: 5. findById(id)
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 6. query document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 7. Genre document
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 8. Genre
deactivate GenreModel

opt Not found
    GenreService --> GenreController: 8.1. Throw NotFound
    GenreController --> Router: 8.2. HTTP 404 response
    Router --> UI: 8.3. Not found error
    UI --> Admin: 8.4. Show error message
end


GenreService -> GenreService: 9. Toggle status
activate GenreService
space
deactivate GenreService
GenreService -> GenreModel: 10. save()
activate GenreModel
GenreModel -> MongoDB: 11. update document
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> GenreModel: 12. Updated document
deactivate MongoDB
GenreModel --> GenreService: 13. Updated genre
deactivate GenreModel

GenreService --> GenreController: 14. Updated genre
deactivate GenreService
GenreController --> Router: 15. HTTP 200 response
deactivate GenreController
Router --> UI: 16. Return updated genre
deactivate Router
UI --> Admin: 17. Toggle status success
deactivate UI
deactivate Admin

@enduml